e</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1332</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#ibn-khaldun">Ibn Khaldun</a> is born in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#tunis">Tunis</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1347</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#marinid-dynasty">Marinid</a> sultan Abu al-Hasan briefly occupies <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#tunis">Tunis</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1394–1434</span><span class="rf-text">Reign of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#abu-faris-abd-al-aziz-ii">Abu Faris Abd al-Aziz II</a> restores <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#hafsid-dynasty">Hafsid</a> power</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1535</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#charles-v-holy-roman-emperor">Charles V</a> takes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#tunis">Tunis</a> and makes the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#hafsid-dynasty">Hafsid</a> sultan a Spanish <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#vassal">vassal</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1574</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#koca-sinan-pasha">Sinan Pasha</a>’s Ottoman forces take <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#tunis">Tunis</a> and end the dynasty</span></li></ol>
